test.yaml:19:19: untrusted input from the variable TITLE (github.event.issue.title) is the program that "exec.exec" runs: it is the start of the command line, so an attacker who controls the value chooses what runs in this step. pass a fixed program and give the value as an argument (exec.exec('tool', [value])), or validate it against a fixed list or a strict pattern first [command-injection]
